      "created_at": "2015-06-12T01:40:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, I can't say I did the calculations...but everything is at least conceptually plausible, and I know Weir based the mission architecture on some real design studies.</p><p>Honestly, our favorite bits are the ones where Watney gives up listening to NASA and just takes things apart to fix them. :)</p>",
